/* Small image layers, cleaned and super-resolved (2x) from the reference video, inlined as
 * WebP data URIs so first paint never waits on a network request.
 *   backdrop    low-res, smooth extension of the studio backdrop for letterboxed / wide screens
 *   plate       studio backdrop + silver scale with its blank display (1760 x 1440)
 *   bagRest     the resting paper bag (video frame 50 onward), Swish print removed
 *   groundRest  the resting bag's shadow on the scale top
 *   sealRest    the tamper tapes and FEEDBACK/QR label for the resting bag (same box as bagRest)
 * The moving bag (video frames 3-49) is larger and lives in ./assets as image files.
 */

